WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:44.385 --> 01:48.105
When does the competition of life really begin?

4
01:50.505 --> 01:54.545
Is it when your parents finally beat all odds to be together?

5
01:55.905 --> 01:58.825
Or when that specific sperm and egg,

6
01:58.905 --> 02:01.905
out of billions, found each other?

7
02:03.025 --> 02:05.825
Then you fight, you grow, follow the set path,

8
02:05.905 --> 02:09.465
and step into a whole new battlefield.

9
02:09.545 --> 02:11.505
You struggle with money and feelings,

10
02:11.585 --> 02:12.545
go through countless suffering,

11
02:12.625 --> 02:15.305
and finally get to show a happy smile.

12
02:15.385 --> 02:16.305
But even then,

13
02:16.385 --> 02:17.225
‎BEICHEN UNIVERSITY ‎COMMENCEMENT CEREMONY

14
02:17.305 --> 02:18.825
you can't afford to let your guard down

15
02:19.345 --> 02:20.825
because you're afraid of failing.

16
02:20.905 --> 02:24.745
Even more afraid of being replaced someday, without warning.

17
02:26.785 --> 02:27.865
WHAT'S THE BIGGEST CHALLENGE YOU'VE EVER FACED?

18
02:27.945 --> 02:29.145
My parents divorced.

19
02:29.225 --> 02:31.345
Since high school, I've been on my own.

20
02:33.465 --> 02:34.985
I have no family to back me up,

21
02:35.065 --> 02:36.945
but I'm not afraid of that challenge.

22
02:37.025 --> 02:39.865
Because compared to the tough job market ahead,

23
02:40.465 --> 02:41.745
it's nothing.

24
02:41.825 --> 02:42.945
It's a good story.

25
02:45.465 --> 02:48.305
YE XINZHI, OPERATIONS DIRECTOR AT P&amp;J

26
02:48.385 --> 02:50.465
P&amp;J INTERNSHIP PROGRAM, SECOND INTERVIEW

27
02:51.745 --> 02:52.585
Thank you.

28
02:55.065 --> 02:57.305
Every story comes from life.

29
02:59.665 --> 03:01.865
Actually, your founder, Mr. Pang Li,

30
03:01.945 --> 03:05.585
said at the APEC summit in July 2006

31
03:05.665 --> 03:09.705
that storytelling and courage are the foundations of success.

32
03:10.225 --> 03:11.865
It's because of those words that I dared to compete

33
03:11.945 --> 03:13.345
for this interview invitation,

34
03:13.425 --> 03:15.305
which used to be only for second-year grad students,

35
03:15.385 --> 03:16.225
during my first-year break.

36
03:17.345 --> 03:19.225
When faced with doubt, agree first,

37
03:19.305 --> 03:20.785
then smoothly steer to another topic.

38
03:22.745 --> 03:23.985
Textbook stiff.

39
03:25.865 --> 03:26.705
-I-- -Next question.

40
03:29.505 --> 03:31.305
What's your life motto?

41
03:43.705 --> 03:45.745
Always work hard,

42
03:46.265 --> 03:50.985
and never, ever become someone

43
03:51.065 --> 03:52.905
who can be easily replaced.

44
03:54.305 --> 03:55.345
Really?

45
03:58.345 --> 03:59.945
Are you that afraid of being replaced?

46
04:01.785 --> 04:03.065
Next.

47
04:03.985 --> 04:05.905
If I get this internship offer from P&amp;J,

48
04:05.985 --> 04:07.345
my job will be locked in when I graduate next year.

49
04:07.425 --> 04:08.505
I'm telling you,

50
04:08.585 --> 04:10.705
that Mr. Ye, who interviewed me last time, is really hot.

51
04:10.785 --> 04:12.065
Totally. I remember him clearly too.

52
04:12.145 --> 04:12.985
‎Hey…

53
04:13.745 --> 04:15.425
With so many people at the interview,

54
04:16.105 --> 04:17.545
I don't feel confident about it.

55
04:19.425 --> 04:20.585
Chi.

56
04:21.384 --> 04:22.425
You just got here?

57
04:22.945 --> 04:24.665
Morning. Got stuck in traffic.

58
04:25.665 --> 04:27.185
You look down.

59
04:27.265 --> 04:28.225
You're definitely not getting in.

60
04:28.745 --> 04:30.665
-What are you saying? -How do you know I won't make it?

61
04:31.345 --> 04:32.385
I'm telling you,

62
04:32.905 --> 04:34.065
I'm getting into P&amp;J now,

63
04:34.145 --> 04:36.505
and later, I'm getting into Maxmise and Boen.

64
04:37.945 --> 04:38.785
Are you kidding me?

65
04:38.865 --> 04:41.585
Top consulting firms like those only hire from top schools.

66
04:42.905 --> 04:46.265
Those who are incompetent always treat "always" and "usually"

67
04:46.345 --> 04:47.945
as unbreakable ceilings.

68
04:48.025 --> 04:50.145
Alright. Stop it.

69
04:51.225 --> 04:53.305
-The interview results are out! Come! -Results are out!

70
04:53.945 --> 04:54.985
I'll go check for you.

71
04:56.545 --> 04:57.545
Excuse me. Coming through.

72
04:57.625 --> 04:58.625
Sorry.

73
04:58.705 --> 04:59.625
‎Wait.

74
05:00.385 --> 05:01.225
NAME, GENDER

75
05:07.905 --> 05:08.665
XU CHI

76
05:08.745 --> 05:09.425
NOT ADMITTED

77
05:09.505 --> 05:10.145
What?

78
05:10.225 --> 05:11.385
Look.

79
05:11.465 --> 05:13.185
-Neither of us made it. -You didn't make it.

80
05:24.345 --> 05:25.465
Scared to look?

81
05:27.665 --> 05:28.505
Congratulations.

82
05:29.785 --> 05:31.105
Ch… Chi.

83
05:31.185 --> 05:33.065
I read the wrong line. You got in.

84
05:37.065 --> 05:37.905
Thank you.

85
05:41.985 --> 05:43.225
Weren't you pretty confident?

86
05:43.305 --> 05:44.625
Why did you chicken out?

87
05:47.505 --> 05:48.585
I didn't.

88
05:49.225 --> 05:51.705
I just didn't believe I'd fail.

89
05:53.625 --> 05:54.785
Big talk.

90
05:55.705 --> 05:57.545
You're good enough for a consumer goods company

91
05:57.625 --> 05:58.625
like P&amp;J,

92
05:59.265 --> 06:02.745
but for consulting firms, you still fall short.

93
06:03.745 --> 06:04.785
How did you know I wanted to get into--?

94
06:04.865 --> 06:06.305
Why do you want to get into Boen and Maxmise?

95
06:08.705 --> 06:10.945
Because, much like P&amp;J, they are all top players in the industry.

96
06:11.905 --> 06:13.105
Since I was little, I've had a dream.

97
06:13.185 --> 06:15.185
I wanted to be the best management talent.

98
06:15.265 --> 06:17.545
Stop reciting from AI scripts.

99
06:20.345 --> 06:23.385
I've always been passionate about international work experience.

100
06:23.465 --> 06:24.705
-Stop. -I--

101
06:24.785 --> 06:27.385
Next time, just talk like a real person.

102
06:28.145 --> 06:29.185
I want money!

103
06:46.265 --> 06:48.385
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

104
06:51.745 --> 06:53.025
I just want money.

105
06:55.465 --> 06:58.145
What I just told you wasn't a story. It's all true.

106
06:58.225 --> 06:59.665
My mom killed herself.

107
07:00.265 --> 07:01.625
My dad married the other woman and had a son.

108
07:02.585 --> 07:04.905
I even had to borrow living expenses from my high school homeroom teacher.

109
07:04.985 --> 07:07.065
So I need money. A lot of it.

110
07:07.145 --> 07:08.665
I need to pay back what I owe.

111
07:09.545 --> 07:10.825
And I need to go work in Beijing.

112
07:11.865 --> 07:14.065
I want to buy back the old apartment my mom couldn't let go of.

113
07:14.145 --> 07:15.985
But I picked the wrong major.

114
07:16.065 --> 07:17.225
As my bachelor's graduation drew near, I figured

115
07:17.305 --> 07:18.185
I couldn't land jobs at major internet companies

116
07:18.265 --> 07:19.225
or make it into investment banking.

117
07:19.305 --> 07:20.865
After grad school,

118
07:20.945 --> 07:22.185
my advisor ran a career-profile assessment on me

119
07:22.265 --> 07:23.625
and said I was suited for management consulting.

120
07:23.705 --> 07:26.185
Consulting firms also pay pretty well for fresh grads.

121
07:26.265 --> 07:27.705
But my school isn't prestigious.

122
07:27.785 --> 07:29.385
My senior told me I could start as a summer intern

123
07:29.465 --> 07:30.665
at a Fortune 500 company first.

124
07:30.745 --> 07:31.825
Once I have experience,

125
07:31.905 --> 07:33.545
I can get an internship at a consulting firm.

126
07:33.625 --> 07:37.065
Top consulting firms haven't been hiring much lately.

127
07:37.145 --> 07:39.025
And they still keep that insane elimination rate.

128
07:39.105 --> 07:41.465
A third of people get cut every year.

129
07:41.545 --> 07:44.465
Sixty percent of new hires leave within the first year.

130
07:44.545 --> 07:46.585
You sure you can last three years?

131
07:48.825 --> 07:51.825
I'm sure. I will never be replaced by anyone.

132
07:52.825 --> 07:56.825
I'll be the one to push out those competing with me first.

133
08:04.065 --> 08:04.985
Then don't go to Maxmise.

134
08:05.065 --> 08:07.265
They won't hire someone from a non-elite school like yours.

135
08:07.865 --> 08:08.985
Go to Beisen instead.

136
08:09.065 --> 08:10.585
Their campus recruitment is more open.

137
08:10.665 --> 08:13.105
If you win an award at Beisen's Yangfan Cup,

138
08:13.185 --> 08:14.985
you get direct access to the final interview.

139
08:15.065 --> 08:16.865
One more piece of advice.

140
08:16.945 --> 08:18.985
Raise your GPA, learn logical methodology well,

141
08:19.065 --> 08:20.345
and read The Pyramid Principle.

142
08:20.425 --> 08:22.665
By the way, drop the name Tracy.

143
08:22.745 --> 08:24.305
In consulting circles, there are 50 Vivians,

144
08:24.385 --> 08:26.345
a hundred Lisas, and 200 Alexes.

145
08:26.425 --> 08:28.385
Don't you want to avoid being replaced?

146
08:28.465 --> 08:31.145
Then make people remember your uniqueness from the very start.

147
08:31.225 --> 08:32.784
Your name is Xu Chi.

148
08:32.865 --> 08:34.024
It's already quite nice.

149
08:34.625 --> 08:36.105
As in "A gentle breeze comes, the sentiments linger."

150
08:37.225 --> 08:38.105
Good luck.

151
09:02.065 --> 09:03.345
In this world,

152
09:03.425 --> 09:04.945
there's always someone who gives you a gentle push

153
09:05.025 --> 09:06.385
when you're lost.

154
09:06.985 --> 09:08.305
Every word Ye Xinzhi said

155
09:08.385 --> 09:10.425
was like a precise coordinate,

156
09:10.505 --> 09:13.145
helping me find direction in the chaos ahead.

157
09:13.665 --> 09:16.545
So I dove straight into the YangFan Cup.

158
09:16.625 --> 09:18.425
With that never-give-up attitude,

159
09:18.505 --> 09:21.705
I landed an offer from the top consulting firm Beisen.

160
09:22.225 --> 09:26.025
And Ye Xinzhi and I were like two parallel lines.

161
09:26.105 --> 09:27.705
After all the twists and turns,

162
09:27.785 --> 09:31.505
who knows when our paths

163
09:31.585 --> 09:33.065
would cross again.

164
09:37.425 --> 09:39.825
‎BEIJING

165
09:41.025 --> 09:42.905
Miss, are you looking at properties?

166
09:44.505 --> 09:46.665
Is the one with the flowers on the second floor for sale?

167
09:46.745 --> 09:48.385
That one? It's not on the market.

168
09:49.185 --> 09:51.145
Alright. Let me know if you need anything. Bye.

169
09:54.145 --> 09:58.665
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

170
09:58.745 --> 10:00.585
This isn't the first time!

171
10:01.665 --> 10:02.905
NAME: CHENGYA

172
10:11.785 --> 10:12.945
Chi.

173
10:14.065 --> 10:15.505
Your dad doesn't want us anymore.

174
10:16.705 --> 10:19.505
He found someone younger and prettier.

175
10:20.505 --> 10:22.345
He's such a scumbag!

176
10:23.505 --> 10:24.705
‎Mom.

177
10:30.265 --> 10:32.625
Chi. I'm sorry.

178
10:32.705 --> 10:35.425
I didn't mean to abandon you.

179
10:35.985 --> 10:38.505
It's just that living hurts too much.

180
10:39.025 --> 10:41.505
I gave so much for your dad.

181
10:42.305 --> 10:44.305
I even sold the apartment in Beijing your grandma left me

182
10:44.385 --> 10:46.385
to fund his business.

183
10:46.905 --> 10:49.505
But he still found another woman.

184
10:50.025 --> 10:51.745
You must remember,

185
10:52.425 --> 10:54.825
even on your own, you still have to work hard

186
10:54.905 --> 10:56.185
-Dad! -and keep striving.

187
10:56.265 --> 10:59.145
-Dad! -Don't end up useless like me,

188
10:59.225 --> 11:02.705
-someone who can be easily replaced. -Dad!

189
11:02.785 --> 11:04.225
Chi.

190
11:04.305 --> 11:06.905
I regret it so much.

191
11:06.985 --> 11:10.145
If we hadn't sold that apartment,

192
11:10.225 --> 11:12.545
we'd still have a home to go back to,

193
11:12.625 --> 11:16.905
and I could've watched the flowers on the windowsill bloom,

194
11:16.985 --> 11:21.465
and you grow up just like before.

195
11:21.545 --> 11:22.825
YONG'AN ROAD COMMUNITY 3-BEDROOM, 4.5 MILLION

196
11:22.905 --> 11:26.825
Mom. I've already got an offer from a Beijing consulting firm now.

197
11:26.905 --> 11:28.425
Just wait a little longer.

198
11:28.505 --> 11:30.945
I will buy back our old apartment.

199
11:31.985 --> 11:34.865
Heard this year's orientation

200
11:34.945 --> 11:37.665
is being run by Samantha, who's about to be made a junior partner.

201
11:37.745 --> 11:39.945
Right now, Maxmise North China has two partners in total.

202
11:40.025 --> 11:40.905
One is Mr. Pi, the other is Mr. Li.

203
11:41.505 --> 11:43.105
Samantha is Mr. Pi's right-hand woman.

204
11:44.425 --> 11:47.265
Xu… Chi.

205
11:47.345 --> 11:49.025
Why is this in pinyin?

206
11:49.105 --> 11:50.185
How do you say that?

207
11:51.825 --> 11:53.505
You don't even have an English name?

208
11:58.585 --> 11:59.625
Xu Chi.

209
11:59.705 --> 12:01.905
As in "A gentle breeze comes, the sentiments linger."

210
12:01.985 --> 12:03.465
I think my name sounds pretty good, so I kept it.

211
12:04.945 --> 12:07.345
Xu Chi? I think it sounds good too.

212
12:07.425 --> 12:09.305
Besides, we're all Chinese.

213
12:09.385 --> 12:11.585
Working at a company in China, using an English name

214
12:11.665 --> 12:14.025
always feels a bit off to me.

215
12:14.545 --> 12:19.425
My name is Zhao Heng.

216
12:20.545 --> 12:21.705
Heng as in "eternal".

217
12:21.785 --> 12:22.905
Emperor Zhenzong of Song?

218
12:23.865 --> 12:25.065
You actually know that.

219
12:25.145 --> 12:28.865
My dad thought it was cool because an emperor used it,

220
12:28.945 --> 12:29.785
but then he worried I couldn't live up to it.

221
12:29.865 --> 12:30.705
I think I can't either.

222
12:31.865 --> 12:33.705
So I changed it to Ben.

223
12:33.785 --> 12:35.545
What's Ben? As in "dumb"!

224
12:36.665 --> 12:38.585
You're actually really good at dad jokes.

225
12:42.065 --> 12:43.145
Oh right.

226
12:43.225 --> 12:44.585
I'm a SJTU economics-management graduate. What about you?

227
12:47.505 --> 12:48.625
I'm in applied statistics.

228
12:49.825 --> 12:51.025
Not answering directly?

229
12:51.105 --> 12:53.425
Guess your school and name aren't worth mentioning.

230
12:54.665 --> 12:56.425
-Don't say that. -What?

231
12:56.505 --> 12:58.625
With this job market,

232
12:58.705 --> 13:01.105
even Maxmise cut 10% of their senior staff.

233
13:01.185 --> 13:03.385
With consulting's high elimination rate,

234
13:03.465 --> 13:05.265
half of us will be gone in the first year.

235
13:06.025 --> 13:07.505
Since we're bound to compete anyway,

236
13:08.105 --> 13:09.985
why bother pretending to be all friendly?

237
13:14.105 --> 13:15.985
You're pretty confident in your abilities, huh?

238
13:20.505 --> 13:21.345
Come here.

239
13:24.585 --> 13:26.065
Yeah, you. Tall one.

240
13:31.705 --> 13:34.985
Do you know the budget for Maxmise's global partnership team?

241
13:39.385 --> 13:41.145
Is she Samantha?

242
13:41.665 --> 13:43.065
Should be.

243
13:44.185 --> 13:45.265
Can't answer?

244
13:46.985 --> 13:48.785
Two hundred million!

245
13:52.385 --> 13:56.025
So, which prestigious school did you graduate from?

246
13:59.385 --> 14:00.425
Cor…

247
14:01.865 --> 14:02.865
Cor what?

248
14:05.265 --> 14:06.265
Cornell.

249
14:07.105 --> 14:08.665
Thought it'd be HYPSM.

250
14:08.745 --> 14:10.345
Turns out you just barely scraped an Ivy.

251
14:10.425 --> 14:11.305
Who asked you?

252
14:13.345 --> 14:15.625
Sorry. The meeting ran long.

253
14:16.305 --> 14:17.305
I'm Sha Sha, Samantha,

254
14:17.385 --> 14:19.025
head of this year's new hire orientation.

255
14:19.105 --> 14:20.785
Have you all gotten to know each other?

256
14:25.705 --> 14:27.185
Alright. Have a seat.

257
14:35.905 --> 14:37.665
-Welcome to Maxmise. -Thank you.

258
14:37.745 --> 14:39.065
From now on,

259
14:39.145 --> 14:41.385
your title is Business Analyst,

260
14:41.465 --> 14:42.385
or BA for short.

261
14:42.465 --> 14:43.385
Business Analyst.

262
14:43.465 --> 14:44.905
Throughout the internship,

263
14:44.985 --> 14:46.905
each of you will join a team

264
14:46.985 --> 14:49.625
and be assigned a senior mentor.

265
14:49.705 --> 14:52.105
You'll also be their assistant.

266
14:52.705 --> 14:55.825
Maxmise gives you the best and fairest opportunities for growth.

267
14:55.905 --> 14:58.065
Bu Tianna's scores are practically perfect.

268
14:58.145 --> 14:58.985
If you're picking, go with her.

269
14:59.825 --> 15:02.025
Her internship record is truly top-tier.

270
15:04.065 --> 15:05.665
Don't any of you fight me on this.

271
15:05.745 --> 15:08.465
I'm taking Bu Tianna.

272
15:09.585 --> 15:11.065
Who would dare go against you?

273
15:11.145 --> 15:13.105
But honey, not to nag,

274
15:14.745 --> 15:16.665
you look terrible these days, yet you’re still pushing yourself so hard.

275
15:17.505 --> 15:19.465
Being a mentor is no easy job.

276
15:20.745 --> 15:22.145
No choice. I've got a huge mortgage,

277
15:22.225 --> 15:24.385
and I've got a little money pit on the way.

278
15:24.465 --> 15:26.385
If I don't fight to get a capable assistant,

279
15:26.465 --> 15:27.505
my projects will get snatched away,

280
15:27.585 --> 15:31.065
just like that Sato Pharmaceuticals deal.

281
15:31.145 --> 15:34.105
Hon, that Sato Pharmaceulticals thing really wasn't my fault.

282
15:34.185 --> 15:36.385
Sha Sha wouldn't let you fly because of your pregnancy risks,

283
15:36.465 --> 15:37.745
so she had me take over midway.

284
15:37.825 --> 15:39.665
I'm heading abroad the day after tomorrow.

285
15:39.745 --> 15:41.505
I'll pick up some skincare for you at duty-free.

286
15:41.585 --> 15:45.065
Someone as easily annoyed as you gets wrinkles fast.

287
15:46.185 --> 15:48.185
Hurry up and choose. We need to go in soon.

288
15:49.465 --> 15:51.345
I'll take this guy, Zhao Heng.

289
15:52.385 --> 15:53.985
Deng Anran.

290
15:55.265 --> 15:56.505
Then I guess I'm stuck with Xu Chi.

291
15:59.385 --> 16:01.385
BU TIANNA, TINA

292
16:02.345 --> 16:04.425
Under the guidance of these mentors and seniors,

293
16:04.505 --> 16:06.465
you'll move forward step by step.

294
16:07.065 --> 16:09.305
Everyone, please stand and welcome your mentors.

295
16:17.705 --> 16:19.905
-Welcome. -Hello.

296
16:20.625 --> 16:23.745
I saw you at the front desk earlier, and I felt we were destined to meet.

297
16:23.825 --> 16:25.345
HALF AN HOUR AGO

298
16:25.425 --> 16:27.145
Hi, I'm Xu Chi. Here to check in.

299
16:27.225 --> 16:28.865
Sure. Please follow me.

300
16:29.665 --> 16:31.825
Thanks, Ms. Lin. I'll do my best.

301
16:34.465 --> 16:36.025
At Maxmise, we don't follow the 9-to-9 six-day schedule,

302
16:36.105 --> 16:37.545
and we won't force you to work overtime.

303
16:37.625 --> 16:40.425
But you might have to get used to running on little sleep from now on.

304
16:40.945 --> 16:43.065
When I was interning in Seattle,

305
16:43.145 --> 16:44.905
I only got six hours of sleep a day.

306
16:44.985 --> 16:47.425
Right. We're here at Maxmise to get tortured.

307
16:48.065 --> 16:50.465
This. This is your desk.

308
16:51.585 --> 16:52.585
Take a look.

309
16:55.425 --> 16:57.585
Among the new hires, you're pretty lucky.

310
16:57.665 --> 16:59.665
I put your desk right across from mine.

311
16:59.745 --> 17:01.385
Makes it easier for us to communicate.

312
17:01.905 --> 17:03.425
-Thank you, Ms. Lin. -Have a seat.

313
17:04.065 --> 17:05.025
Get familiar with things.

314
17:05.105 --> 17:07.424
Here's your computer and the employee handbook.

315
17:16.944 --> 17:18.704
Why did you push her away?

316
17:18.785 --> 17:20.224
Isn't that just handing her to Cindy?

317
17:21.505 --> 17:22.944
Her full name is Bu Tianna.

318
17:23.025 --> 17:23.865
BU TIANNA

319
17:23.944 --> 17:26.585
Remember that Qianhai Bank project we did?

320
17:26.665 --> 17:28.025
That's the name listed

321
17:28.105 --> 17:30.385
as the beneficiary of Mr. Bu's family trust at Siwei Group.

322
17:32.425 --> 17:34.905
No wonder Mr. Pi personally interviewed her.

323
17:34.985 --> 17:36.585
She's the real deal.

324
17:36.665 --> 17:38.225
Rich, well-connected, and capable.

325
17:38.305 --> 17:39.785
If she got into my team,

326
17:39.865 --> 17:41.305
by the time I come back from maternity leave,

327
17:41.385 --> 17:43.665
my projects would just be stepping stones for her.

328
17:44.825 --> 17:45.705
Might as well let Cindy taste

329
17:45.785 --> 17:47.865
what it's like to work for someone else's gain.

330
17:48.785 --> 17:50.065
I've always worried

331
17:50.145 --> 17:51.865
about being sidelined because of all my time off.

332
17:51.945 --> 17:53.745
Why would I want a mentee who's that capable?

333
17:53.825 --> 17:55.305
Makes sense.

334
17:55.385 --> 17:57.985
Xu Chi does seem pretty steady.

335
17:58.065 --> 18:00.465
She got dissed like that and still didn't snap back.

336
18:01.905 --> 18:04.545
This girl doesn't fight or scheme.

337
18:04.625 --> 18:05.905
I actually like her.

338
18:05.985 --> 18:07.665
Sure. Please follow me.

339
18:09.265 --> 18:10.305
Ms. Lin.

340
18:10.385 --> 18:11.225
Thanks.

341
18:12.385 --> 18:13.905
Did you get her resume during the interviews?

342
18:13.985 --> 18:15.105
What's her background?

343
18:15.185 --> 18:16.385
I'm not sure.

344
18:16.465 --> 18:18.265
I just remember she doesn't have an overseas degree.

345
18:24.425 --> 18:25.905
As long as she follows my orders

346
18:25.985 --> 18:27.745
while I'm on maternity leave, that's all that matters.

347
18:27.825 --> 18:29.985
Right. I'll get back to work then.

348
18:36.385 --> 18:38.065
-How's it going? -Ms. Lin,

349
18:38.585 --> 18:40.305
you didn't look too well.

350
18:40.385 --> 18:42.305
I read online that chocolate can help.

351
18:46.305 --> 18:47.665
You're so sweet.

352
18:47.745 --> 18:49.225
Have a seat.

353
18:49.305 --> 18:50.785
-Did you read the employee handbook? -I did.

354
18:50.865 --> 18:53.345
It has your email and your system username and password.

355
18:53.425 --> 18:54.945
-Got it. -I'll send you the work plan

356
18:55.025 --> 18:56.745
for the next few days later. Take a look.

357
18:56.825 --> 18:58.825
If you don't understand anything, feel free to ask me.

358
18:58.905 --> 19:00.185
Sure. No problem.

359
19:01.105 --> 19:03.145
Our work is simple, in a way.

360
19:03.225 --> 19:04.425
Start with data analysis.

361
19:04.505 --> 19:06.265
-Ever heard of Bolo Culture? -Yes.

362
19:07.025 --> 19:10.065
Pull Bolo Culture's data from the database and do a basic analysis.

363
19:10.145 --> 19:11.345
No problem.

364
19:16.625 --> 19:17.465
Here's a tip.

365
19:17.545 --> 19:19.865
Don't always say "yes" or "sure" to everything when you're new.

366
19:19.945 --> 19:20.785
Sounds too much like a student.

367
19:20.865 --> 19:22.025
In the workplace,

368
19:22.105 --> 19:24.865
unless you're truly capable of taking responsibility,

369
19:24.945 --> 19:27.025
don't just casually say "no problem".

370
19:31.745 --> 19:32.705
Go on.

371
19:43.745 --> 19:46.505
If you're not feeling well, you should head home early.

372
19:46.585 --> 19:47.705
If you collapse from exhaustion,

373
19:47.785 --> 19:48.825
we'll have to call an ambulance for you.

374
19:48.905 --> 19:49.865
That'll just hold everyone up.

375
19:50.465 --> 19:51.945
Relax. I can still hang on.

376
19:52.625 --> 19:53.585
With you off to Japan,

377
19:53.665 --> 19:55.265
if something goes wrong here,

378
19:55.345 --> 19:57.585
I'll have to clean up for you.

379
20:03.025 --> 20:04.665
The report's done and sent to your email.

380
20:07.945 --> 20:09.105
That fast?

381
20:09.185 --> 20:11.865
I've been following the online reading industry for a while.

382
20:11.945 --> 20:12.785
So…

383
20:12.865 --> 20:14.905
You want to prove yourself. I get it.

384
20:14.985 --> 20:16.865
But honestly, there's no need to rush like that.

385
20:16.945 --> 20:20.425
Plus, Maxmise has its own formatting rules for documents.

386
20:20.505 --> 20:22.785
Not like the ones you did in school--

387
20:24.865 --> 20:25.905
CONTENTS

388
20:25.985 --> 20:27.065
CONTENTS, EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

389
20:27.145 --> 20:28.625
PROJECT BACKGROUND INTEGRATION CHALLENGES…

390
20:32.305 --> 20:33.185
I did my homework.

391
20:33.785 --> 20:35.225
Not bad.

392
20:36.025 --> 20:37.905
But where did you get all this data from Nielsu

393
20:37.985 --> 20:39.225
and those business research firms?

394
20:39.305 --> 20:41.225
I don't remember the company buying those.

395
20:41.305 --> 20:42.585
I bought them myself.

396
20:46.145 --> 20:47.825
But how could a student afford

397
20:47.905 --> 20:49.785
such expensive business research databases?

398
20:50.945 --> 20:52.305
If you want to get into Maxmise,

399
20:52.385 --> 20:54.025
you have to pay some tuition yourself.

400
20:54.105 --> 20:55.665
Being prepared is never wrong.

401
20:57.945 --> 20:59.425
Nice report.

402
20:59.505 --> 21:00.985
I'll send you the Yuanming project files later.

403
21:01.065 --> 21:01.905
Keep doing the analysis.

404
21:01.985 --> 21:03.225
Okay.

405
21:27.825 --> 21:28.745
Ma'am, your coffee.

406
21:28.825 --> 21:29.905
Thank you.

407
21:36.905 --> 21:37.825
Sorry.

408
21:38.985 --> 21:40.665
-Thanks. -No worries.

409
21:42.865 --> 21:44.985
Actually, I've been watching you for a while.

410
21:46.345 --> 21:48.905
Your folders are organized like you have OCD.

411
21:48.985 --> 21:51.785
All your files end with V1, V2, V3.

412
21:51.865 --> 21:55.665
And those blue slide templates with no images.

413
21:55.745 --> 21:57.705
Are you a consultant?

414
21:57.785 --> 21:59.745
You're an executive at Beihuan Air, right?

415
22:00.785 --> 22:02.425
Public relations side?

416
22:02.505 --> 22:03.745
Yes.

417
22:03.825 --> 22:04.785
I'm heading to Beijing for a headquarters meeting.

418
22:05.905 --> 22:08.145
Attention, all passengers.

419
22:08.225 --> 22:10.865
Flight to Beijing is now boarding.

420
22:10.945 --> 22:12.505
-Please prepare for boarding. -I need to board.

421
22:13.305 --> 22:15.745
I'm on the next flight to Beijing.

422
22:15.825 --> 22:18.105
After we land, do you want to grab a drink sometime?

423
22:18.185 --> 22:19.305
Sorry.

424
22:19.385 --> 22:20.785
I've got work arrangements today. Maybe some other time.

425
22:21.385 --> 22:23.705
Who knows when we'll run into each other again.

426
22:23.785 --> 22:26.025
Soon. I have a feeling.

427
22:31.105 --> 22:35.865
Thank you all for your contributions to Beihuan Air over the years.

428
22:36.945 --> 22:38.185
HR will have one-on-one meetings

429
22:38.265 --> 22:41.705
with everyone about the specific compensation details later.

430
22:55.225 --> 22:57.825
Every business war has its casualties.

431
22:58.345 --> 22:59.385
A consultant's job

432
22:59.465 --> 23:02.305
is to secure the biggest win with the smallest sacrifice

433
23:02.385 --> 23:05.065
and keep companies from going into bankruptcy and restructuring.

434
23:05.145 --> 23:08.825
If your company was laying you off,

435
23:08.905 --> 23:10.625
would you still say that?

436
23:12.025 --> 23:13.185
These past two years,

437
23:13.265 --> 23:15.945
top consulting firms worldwide have been laying off staff.

438
23:16.625 --> 23:18.545
Even the best organizations need constant elimination and evolution.

439
23:19.225 --> 23:20.785
No one is irreplaceable.

440
23:20.865 --> 23:21.785
Not even me.

441
23:22.305 --> 23:25.385
PROMOTE OR QUIT

442
23:25.465 --> 23:27.985
Wake up. Don't zone out. Let's hype ourselves up again.

443
23:28.065 --> 23:30.305
We've gotta get this done today.

444
23:30.385 --> 23:31.345
No more hype.

445
23:31.425 --> 23:33.385
My blood is pure coffee at this point.

446
23:33.465 --> 23:35.065
It's due tomorrow.

447
23:35.145 --> 23:36.505
And now the lead has a heart attack.

448
23:36.585 --> 23:38.385
With all this work, how are we supposed to finish?

449
23:38.465 --> 23:41.065
Headquarters is sending a big gun to support us.

450
23:42.505 --> 23:43.705
Morning.

451
23:43.785 --> 23:44.825
Richard!

452
23:45.985 --> 23:48.425
Hello, everyone. I'm Ye Xinzhi, sent from headquarters to take over.

453
23:48.505 --> 23:50.145
Who's the project manager here?

454
23:50.225 --> 23:51.705
Let me see today's summary.

455
23:52.745 --> 23:54.265
Who's that?

456
23:54.345 --> 23:55.945
You don't know Mr. Ye?

457
23:56.025 --> 23:58.105
He's the fastest-promoted partner at C&amp;C Consulting.

458
23:58.185 --> 24:00.945
He single-handedly closed the Beihuan Air project.

459
24:01.025 --> 24:03.185
That impressive? Then we're saved this time.

460
24:03.265 --> 24:04.185
Everyone,

461
24:05.585 --> 24:06.945
you've done great work so far.

462
24:07.025 --> 24:09.665
Now, let's go through the delivery plan together.

463
24:09.745 --> 24:10.665
Okay.

464
24:11.625 --> 24:15.745
Cancel delivery files 003, 007, 013, and 021.

465
24:15.825 --> 24:17.025
Merge 004 and 009.

466
24:17.105 --> 24:19.505
Based on my experience, with everyone working together,

467
24:19.585 --> 24:21.825
we can get this done in eight hours.

468
24:21.905 --> 24:24.305
So here's what I'm assigning.

469
24:24.385 --> 24:26.025
Go back to your rooms and rest for five hours.

470
24:26.105 --> 24:28.145
But the final delivery meeting is tomorrow morning!

471
24:28.905 --> 24:30.305
I've already talked to the client.

472
24:30.385 --> 24:31.705
Pushed it to tomorrow afternoon at four.

473
24:32.585 --> 24:33.865
Everyone's exhausted.

474
24:33.945 --> 24:36.265
Without rest, efficiency drops.

475
24:38.305 --> 24:39.265
Amazing.

476
24:39.345 --> 24:41.625
But I just chugged two big cans of Red Bull.

477
24:41.705 --> 24:44.345
My brain is both tired and wired. I can't sleep at all.

478
24:45.585 --> 24:46.585
I'll figure something out.

479
24:58.065 --> 25:01.665
Yang Rui, I found some issues with the Yuanming project.

480
25:03.785 --> 25:05.105
YANG RUI: DATA ERRORS IN THE YUANMING PROJECT

481
25:05.185 --> 25:06.345
GO TO THE SITE AND VERIFY NOW

482
25:24.545 --> 25:25.985
You should go to the restroom and deal with that.

483
25:26.065 --> 25:27.105
There's a hairdryer there.

484
25:27.185 --> 25:29.625
I really didn't know joining Maxmise meant suffering like this.

485
25:29.705 --> 25:32.265
I thought the worst would be stuck at the airport during a typhoon.

486
25:32.345 --> 25:33.865
Five-thirty in the morning.

487
25:33.945 --> 25:36.665
My mentor actually wants me to verify data on-site

488
25:36.745 --> 25:37.705
-that even the VPA system can't pull. -Morning.

489
25:37.785 --> 25:38.665
Morning.

490
25:40.785 --> 25:43.185
Ma'am, she's the first one here again?

491
25:43.265 --> 25:45.185
Yes. She's first every day.

492
25:46.505 --> 25:47.705
Crazy.

493
25:48.505 --> 25:49.665
You don't get it?

494
25:49.745 --> 25:51.345
That's called scoring points.

495
25:52.945 --> 25:55.625
I'd love to go to a site and score points too.

496
25:56.505 --> 25:58.385
But I don't have that kind of client.

497
25:59.105 --> 26:00.425
My mentor's no help!

498
26:02.905 --> 26:03.745
It's time for work.

499
26:09.465 --> 26:11.145
You're really lucky.

500
26:11.225 --> 26:12.585
You got one who's ready to work.

501
26:12.665 --> 26:14.065
Jealous?

502
26:15.065 --> 26:17.385
No wonder Sha Sha made an exception to hire her.

503
26:17.905 --> 26:19.265
You know Du Wen's mentee?

504
26:19.345 --> 26:22.825
Can't even figure out a simple tool like SPSS.

505
26:22.905 --> 26:24.425
Gave him a massive headache.

506
26:24.505 --> 26:26.385
That won't last long, anyway.

507
26:26.465 --> 26:27.865
Once the three-month probation is over,

508
26:27.945 --> 26:30.105
at least half these interns will be gone.

509
26:32.425 --> 26:34.945
Hey, how's Cindy doing?

510
26:35.025 --> 26:36.185
You sit close to her.

511
26:36.265 --> 26:37.545
Heard anything lately?

512
26:39.385 --> 26:40.905
You were right.

513
26:40.985 --> 26:41.865
You know what?

514
26:41.945 --> 26:45.505
Cindy invited Mr. Zheng from Dongfang Data to play golf and have dinner.

515
26:45.585 --> 26:47.065
She asked Bu Tianna to join them at night.

516
26:47.145 --> 26:48.665
You know what Bu Tianna said?

517
26:49.385 --> 26:52.545
"I already have plans tonight."

518
26:52.625 --> 26:54.425
Before Cindy could even react,

519
26:54.505 --> 26:56.665
Mr. Zheng called and canceled the dinner.

520
26:58.585 --> 27:00.905
She thought she'd scored a gem.

521
27:00.985 --> 27:01.865
And then?

522
27:02.385 --> 27:03.785
She just has to take the loss.

523
27:03.865 --> 27:05.825
If you want to move up, you pay the price.

524
27:06.865 --> 27:08.225
Don't forget Maxmise's rule.

525
27:10.465 --> 27:12.305
-Get promoted or get out. -Get promoted or get out.

526
27:12.865 --> 27:14.465
Come on. Let's toast.

527
27:31.145 --> 27:33.265
-Morning. -Morning.

528
27:34.585 --> 27:35.865
Just graduated and already looking to buy an apartment?

529
27:35.945 --> 27:37.425
Pretty ambitious for a young person.

530
27:37.505 --> 27:38.785
Gotta make good money.

531
27:40.225 --> 27:42.185
The agent sent it to me. I was just browsing.

532
27:43.305 --> 27:45.665
-What proposal are you working on? -The proposal of Bolo Culture.

533
27:45.745 --> 27:47.385
Once Ms. Lin reviews it, I'll send it over to you.

534
27:56.785 --> 27:57.785
Clean work.

535
27:58.705 --> 28:02.185
Lin Long has been praising you a lot these days.

536
28:02.265 --> 28:03.345
By the way, where do you live?

537
28:03.425 --> 28:05.585
How do you get to the office so early every day?

538
28:06.625 --> 28:08.425
Just around the corner at the diplomatic compound--

539
28:08.505 --> 28:09.465
Diplomatic compound?

540
28:09.545 --> 28:11.185
That's not cheap, is it?

541
28:11.265 --> 28:14.265
There's a 9 Days Inn nearby. I've rented a standard room long-term.

542
28:14.785 --> 28:16.665
A standard room at 9 Days Inn?

543
28:16.745 --> 28:20.105
That's probably just a bed and a bathroom. So small.

544
28:20.185 --> 28:22.665
It's fine. Enough for me.

545
28:22.745 --> 28:24.545
Bigger than my dorm room.

546
28:24.625 --> 28:27.465
It's slightly more expensive than a studio,

547
28:27.545 --> 28:31.145
but I'll be working at least ten hours a day

548
28:31.225 --> 28:33.065
and traveling at least eight times a month.

549
28:33.145 --> 28:35.425
Compared to a landlord who might kick me out anytime,

550
28:35.505 --> 28:38.425
a hotel with 24/7 hot water and Wi-Fi suits me much better.

551
28:39.065 --> 28:39.905
Why push yourself so hard?

552
28:41.265 --> 28:43.985
If I didn't, you wouldn't have noticed me

553
28:44.065 --> 28:45.785
or asked me that question.

554
28:47.825 --> 28:50.265
After you read my report, if you think it's decent,

555
28:50.785 --> 28:53.385
can I join Ms. Lin for the proposal meeting?

556
28:54.625 --> 28:56.865
We have no precedent for interns joining proposal meetings.

557
28:57.665 --> 28:59.545
I'll prove with my report

558
28:59.625 --> 29:01.585
that I'm already at a full-time employee's level.

559
29:05.905 --> 29:08.865
Our project proposal is in the final stage.

560
29:09.985 --> 29:11.865
Yang Rui's team is swamped anyway.

561
29:11.945 --> 29:13.745
Since on-site inspection is so important,

562
29:13.825 --> 29:15.505
why not send Bu Tianna to get some experience?

563
29:15.585 --> 29:17.225
You think she doesn't listen to you enough,

564
29:17.305 --> 29:18.905
so you want to knock her down a peg, don't you?

565
29:19.785 --> 29:21.865
Cindy, as a mentor,

566
29:21.945 --> 29:23.905
you should have a broader mindset.

567
29:23.985 --> 29:26.025
Tianna is still a fine blade that needs sharpening.

568
29:26.105 --> 29:28.825
But you can't dull her on a construction site.

569
29:31.065 --> 29:33.265
I read the Bolo Culture documents. Not bad.

570
29:34.105 --> 29:35.585
Just a bit conservative in style.

571
29:35.665 --> 29:37.905
Why don't you bring Xu Chi to the proposal meeting this time?

572
29:37.985 --> 29:38.945
She's young.

573
29:39.025 --> 29:41.505
Perfect for her to connect with those new unicorn startup folks.

574
29:43.225 --> 29:44.745
The industry summit organized by the Research

575
29:44.825 --> 29:45.665
is coming up in a couple of days.

576
29:45.745 --> 29:47.745
Mr. Pi said we should go help out.

577
29:48.665 --> 29:49.545
Okay.

578
29:50.065 --> 29:51.585
In our team…

579
29:54.385 --> 29:56.065
-I'll get to work then. -Go ahead.

580
30:00.625 --> 30:02.025
Need a reminder?

581
30:03.345 --> 30:05.265
The surname Bu isn't common.

582
30:08.945 --> 30:10.105
Remember now?

583
30:10.905 --> 30:13.065
You usually seem pretty sharp.

584
30:13.145 --> 30:14.425
How'd you get so dense this time?

585
30:17.105 --> 30:18.385
Guess that's why we're friends.

586
30:18.465 --> 30:20.545
Even you got fooled by Xu Chi. My situation is nothing.

587
30:22.305 --> 30:24.945
You know why Sha Sha asked you to bring Xu Chi to the proposal meeting?

588
30:25.945 --> 30:27.225
This morning…

589
30:29.785 --> 30:32.225
Lin Long has been praising you a lot these days.

590
30:32.825 --> 30:35.345
Can I join Ms. Lin for the proposal meeting?

591
30:38.785 --> 30:40.385
Lately, you've been leaving before eight.

592
30:40.465 --> 30:41.905
Xu Chi handles most of the work now.

593
30:41.985 --> 30:43.225
Feels pretty easy?

594
30:43.305 --> 30:46.265
Ms. Lin, you're pregnant. You shouldn't overdo it.

595
30:46.345 --> 30:48.465
Why don't you head home? I'll handle the rest.

596
30:49.065 --> 30:49.825
Thank you.

597
30:51.225 --> 30:53.505
Jealous? You're really lucky.

598
30:53.585 --> 30:55.185
You got one who's ready to work.

599
30:55.825 --> 30:58.825
You really don't know why Yang Rui's team is so swamped?

600
30:58.905 --> 31:01.785
Because Xu Chi has sharp eyes.

601
31:08.265 --> 31:10.865
She spotted a data error he missed.

602
31:10.945 --> 31:13.505
And she sent the email under your team's name.

603
31:13.585 --> 31:16.065
Since the Yuanming project is a collaboration with Yang Rui's team,

604
31:16.145 --> 31:18.585
can I just communicate with them directly?

605
31:18.665 --> 31:20.825
Sure. On this project, we're the front end.

606
31:20.905 --> 31:21.745
They're the back end.

607
31:24.665 --> 31:26.625
She embarrassed him.

608
31:26.705 --> 31:27.545
YANG RUI

609
31:27.625 --> 31:28.985
Data errors found in the Yuanming project.

610
31:29.065 --> 31:30.705
Go to the site and verify now.

611
31:31.385 --> 31:33.225
Sorry, Yang Rui. I'm on my way.

612
31:33.305 --> 31:34.545
I'll verify the data on-site right away.

613
31:34.625 --> 31:36.225
I'll have it done before work starts.

614
31:36.305 --> 31:39.425
Deng Anran was forced to go to the site and recheck every single piece of data.

615
31:41.625 --> 31:44.225
You forgot what happened between them when they first joined?

616
31:44.305 --> 31:45.265
You don't even have an English name?

617
31:46.025 --> 31:47.185
Not answering directly?

618
31:47.265 --> 31:49.625
Guess your school and name aren't worth mentioning.

619
31:49.705 --> 31:52.865
You've been used as a pawn.

620
31:53.465 --> 31:54.545
No way.

621
31:55.185 --> 31:56.825
Why not?

622
31:57.705 --> 31:59.265
You thought she was a pushover.

623
31:59.345 --> 32:02.465
She waited until everyone forgot, then got her revenge.

624
32:02.545 --> 32:04.585
She is more calculating than you.

625
32:05.505 --> 32:08.025
Now she's bypassed you and gone straight to Sha Sha for the proposal.

626
32:08.625 --> 32:12.225
By the time you're back, your spot will be gone.

627
32:12.305 --> 32:14.265
And you thought you'd found a gem.

628
32:26.785 --> 32:29.545
Zhao Heng. Do you know where Xu Chi went?

629
32:29.625 --> 32:31.625
She's in Meeting Room B, meeting visitors.

630
32:32.345 --> 32:33.465
Visitors?

631
32:34.905 --> 32:36.665
You mean e-commerce formation?

632
32:36.745 --> 32:39.465
Yes. Our strategy actually serves the national priorities,

633
32:39.545 --> 32:41.305
rural revitalization, healthcare, emergency response,

634
32:41.385 --> 32:42.385
and down-market e-commerce.

635
32:42.465 --> 32:43.505
Xu Chi.

636
32:44.665 --> 32:45.745
Step out for a moment.

637
32:47.225 --> 32:48.185
One second, please.

638
32:52.585 --> 32:53.585
What's up, Ms. Lin?

639
32:54.905 --> 32:55.865
Who are those people?

640
32:57.585 --> 32:59.785
They're from the Beijing Low-Altitude Economy Industry Research Institute.

641
32:59.865 --> 33:03.105
The Yuanming drone logistics project has some policy issues,

642
33:03.185 --> 33:04.545
so I invited them over for a workshop.

643
33:04.625 --> 33:06.105
I asked you about it yesterday.

644
33:06.185 --> 33:08.465
I said we could consider it. I didn't say to do it right away.

645
33:08.545 --> 33:10.745
What are their titles? How credible are they?

646
33:10.825 --> 33:13.425
You just grab any random people and call it a workshop?

647
33:13.505 --> 33:14.905
Trying to cash in on Maxmise's name?

648
33:14.985 --> 33:17.825
And did you apply for a budget for their appearance fees?

649
33:17.905 --> 33:21.985
Xu Chi, do you think just because I've been praising you lately,

650
33:22.065 --> 33:24.185
you can get cocky and make your own calls?

651
33:28.305 --> 33:31.065
The one at the far end is Deputy Director Zheng.

652
33:31.145 --> 33:32.385
Next to him is Section Chief Song,

653
33:32.465 --> 33:33.705
who oversees the low-altitude economy in the district.

654
33:34.385 --> 33:36.025
This workshop doesn't need a budget.

655
33:36.105 --> 33:37.385
I traded a free share of Maxmise's

656
33:37.465 --> 33:39.465
Southeast Asia logistics industry report for it.

657
33:39.545 --> 33:41.985
Also, I was able to get them here so quickly

658
33:42.065 --> 33:45.025
because I once did a winter break internship

659
33:45.105 --> 33:46.465
at Mr. Zheng's Tiandi Logistics.

660
33:46.545 --> 33:48.025
He's always had a good impression of me.

661
33:48.105 --> 33:49.185
Even so,

662
33:49.265 --> 33:50.985
who said you could share our report for free?

663
33:54.665 --> 33:56.625
Xu Chi, your delivery is here.

664
33:56.705 --> 33:58.065
Great. Thanks.

665
33:58.665 --> 34:00.265
Let me finish the meeting first. I'll talk to you after.

666
34:01.225 --> 34:02.785
Sorry for the wait.

667
34:03.305 --> 34:04.345
-Mr. Zheng. -Well, well.

668
34:04.425 --> 34:06.145
This is your favorite oat latte.

669
34:06.905 --> 34:07.825
Thank you.

670
34:08.425 --> 34:11.625
-And Mr. Song's Americano. -Thanks.

671
34:12.705 --> 34:14.145
-Over here. -Alright, Xu.

672
34:14.225 --> 34:15.545
-We'll catch up next time. -Alright.

673
34:16.744 --> 34:19.705
Xu, keep me posted on the project progress.

674
34:19.784 --> 34:20.625
I will, Mr. Song. Thank you.

675
34:20.705 --> 34:21.744
-See you. -Bye.

676
34:21.824 --> 34:22.744
Take care.

677
34:26.185 --> 34:27.344
Xu Chi.

678
34:29.985 --> 34:31.145
Lin Long stepped out.

679
34:31.225 --> 34:32.264
She told me

680
34:32.344 --> 34:34.425
you don't need to attend the Bolo Culture workshop this afternoon.

681
34:35.025 --> 34:37.145
The Research is hosting an industry summit at Dongfang Hotel.

682
34:37.225 --> 34:39.185
They're short-handed on the Conference Team.

683
34:39.264 --> 34:40.225
She wants you to go help out there.

684
34:42.865 --> 34:44.145
Got it. Thanks.

685
34:46.065 --> 34:49.905
Are you getting pushed back because you performed too well?

686
34:52.505 --> 34:53.344
So what?

687
34:53.945 --> 34:55.585
It was made clear on day one.

688
34:55.665 --> 34:57.145
Mentors are just mentors.

689
34:57.225 --> 35:00.745
Whether an intern stays is ultimately Sha Sha's call.

690
35:00.825 --> 35:03.025
As long as I stay at Maxmise, a couple of years from now,

691
35:03.105 --> 35:04.505
tables could turn.

692
35:07.065 --> 35:10.465
I'm glad someone else gets that too.

693
35:21.025 --> 35:22.225
It's heavy. Easy.

694
35:22.305 --> 35:23.385
Over here.

695
35:23.465 --> 35:27.225
This is the additional venue setup as you requested.

696
35:28.865 --> 35:30.145
Take care.

697
35:30.225 --> 35:31.105
Excuse me.

698
35:34.665 --> 35:35.505
Mr. Pi?

699
35:37.745 --> 35:39.545
-Mr. Pi? -Go on.

700
35:39.625 --> 35:41.265
The halal and vegan options

701
35:41.345 --> 35:44.225
you requested for the lunch guests have all been taken care of.

702
35:44.305 --> 35:45.145
Got it.

703
35:57.825 --> 36:00.025
You sent Xu Chi to do grunt work?

704
36:00.105 --> 36:03.265
If you want to knock her down, at least don't make it so obvious.

705
36:03.345 --> 36:05.585
I'm telling you, Mr. Pi knows.

706
36:06.225 --> 36:07.265
So what?

707
36:07.345 --> 36:08.785
Deng Anran got sent to a construction site.

708
36:08.865 --> 36:10.865
Can't Xu Chi go to a hotel to help out?

709
36:12.225 --> 36:13.985
Let me tell you some real tea.

710
36:14.065 --> 36:15.545
You don't know she's from a non-elite school, do you?

711
36:17.505 --> 36:20.745
I only knew she didn't study abroad and that she's not from a top school.

712
36:20.825 --> 36:22.465
How did someone not from a top school get into Maxmise?

713
36:23.705 --> 36:24.545
You…

714
36:24.625 --> 36:26.265
Sit, sit. Have a seat.

715
36:26.345 --> 36:27.705
What are you doing?

716
36:29.065 --> 36:31.305
Because she and the SJTU team

717
36:31.385 --> 36:34.305
won first place in Beisen's Yangfan Cup business competition.

718
36:36.905 --> 36:39.905
Her champion title was judged by Mr. Pi himself.

719
36:40.985 --> 36:43.025
She was actually planning to go to Beisen,

720
36:43.105 --> 36:46.745
but you know, Beisen moved its headquarters to Shenzhen this year,

721
36:46.825 --> 36:47.865
so she hesitated.

722
36:48.465 --> 36:49.545
When Mr. Pi found out,

723
36:49.625 --> 36:51.745
he sent her an offer right away.

724
36:51.825 --> 36:54.905
You know what her GPA is?

725
36:54.985 --> 36:56.825
3.95.

726
36:57.545 --> 36:59.545
Last night after midnight,

727
36:59.625 --> 37:00.905
Mr. Pi came to the office to grab some files

728
37:00.985 --> 37:04.305
and heard about Xu Chi's workshop plan.

729
37:04.385 --> 37:05.665
He read it and was impressed.

730
37:05.745 --> 37:08.385
He approved her sharing the report for free on the spot.

731
37:08.465 --> 37:11.505
And then you turned around and sent her to do grunt work.

732
37:11.585 --> 37:13.385
Aren't you basically slapping Mr. Pi in the face?

733
37:13.905 --> 37:14.985
Even so,

734
37:15.065 --> 37:16.785
who said you could share our report for free?

735
37:20.385 --> 37:22.905
Just now, Mr. Pi called the Conference Team

736
37:22.985 --> 37:26.545
and asked why they pulled a project colleague to do errands.

737
37:30.625 --> 37:33.905
You know how fierce the competition is in consulting right now.

738
37:34.505 --> 37:37.345
Xu Chi is clearly someone who can really get things done.

739
37:37.425 --> 37:39.505
If you piss off Mr. Pi because of her,

740
37:39.585 --> 37:42.745
aren't you afraid he'll give you a hard time at work?

741
37:49.185 --> 37:50.905
Think about what you're going to do. I've got work.

742
38:09.865 --> 38:10.745
Xu Chi.

743
38:10.825 --> 38:12.705
Come back after you pick up the guest at the airport.

744
38:12.785 --> 38:14.545
Mr. Pi chewed us out because of you.

745
38:14.625 --> 38:16.785
Oh, did you get the pickup sign?

746
38:16.865 --> 38:19.345
I already got it. Don't worry.

747
38:25.185 --> 38:27.025
I will never be replaced by anyone.

748
38:27.105 --> 38:30.185
I'll be the one to push out those competing with me first.

749
38:33.225 --> 38:34.585
XU CHI

750
38:34.665 --> 38:35.865
Thanks.

751
38:35.945 --> 38:37.145
You're welcome.

752
38:37.225 --> 38:40.585
I just told the lobby manager at Dongfang Hotel

753
38:40.665 --> 38:42.465
to ask Mr. Pi to step out for a chat.

754
38:42.545 --> 38:44.305
XU CHI, BU TIANNA

755
38:44.385 --> 38:45.345
Why do you keep helping me?

756
38:46.225 --> 38:49.065
I'm going to become a partner someday.

757
38:49.145 --> 38:51.625
I just want to start building my inner circle early.

758
38:54.665 --> 38:56.345
Too bad that when I play chess,

759
38:56.425 --> 38:58.105
I'm not good at being a knight.

760
38:58.705 --> 38:59.865
I'm only good at being the queen.

761
39:00.385 --> 39:01.465
Really?

762
39:13.185 --> 39:15.305
The Beihuan Air project is done.

763
39:15.385 --> 39:17.465
This time I'm here for the Tianhe project.

764
39:18.585 --> 39:21.665
Right, send me the data again so I can take a look.

765
39:24.345 --> 39:25.305
Okay.

766
39:38.065 --> 39:40.505
Mr. Yi, we'll be at the hotel in half an hour.

767
39:40.585 --> 39:42.585
Your room service order for the Caesar salad is on its way.

768
39:43.185 --> 39:44.465
I hate Caesar salad.

769
39:49.905 --> 39:51.305
Did you pick up the wrong person?

770
39:53.265 --> 39:54.225
Sir, please pull over.

771
39:54.305 --> 39:55.185
Sure.

772
39:57.625 --> 39:58.745
RICHARD YE, DONGFANG HOTEL

773
40:00.025 --> 40:01.065
Sorry.

774
40:06.025 --> 40:08.985
Mr. Yi, I'm from Maxmise, who texted you earlier to pick you up.

775
40:10.265 --> 40:11.825
Still waiting for your luggage? No worries. Take your time.

776
40:11.905 --> 40:14.065
I'll take a lap around the other floors.

777
40:14.665 --> 40:15.785
Okay. I'll wait for your call.

778
40:18.385 --> 40:20.785
Mr. Ye, I'm sorry. I didn't double-check the name on the pickup sign.

779
40:20.865 --> 40:22.865
I have two temporary solutions.

780
40:22.945 --> 40:24.265
One, I can take you back to the airport.

781
40:24.345 --> 40:25.985
Two, if you're in a hurry,

782
40:26.065 --> 40:27.145
I'll have the driver take you to the hotel,

783
40:27.225 --> 40:29.185
and then I'll get off and order another car for Mr. Yi.

784
40:29.265 --> 40:30.585
Which option works better for you?

785
40:31.265 --> 40:32.305
One.

786
40:33.905 --> 40:35.105
Please drive back to the airport. And hurry.

787
40:35.705 --> 40:37.305
-Alright. -You remember me?

788
40:39.505 --> 40:40.345
Of course.

789
40:41.825 --> 40:43.785
Admitted the mistake cleanly. Didn't pass the buck.

790
40:43.865 --> 40:46.185
Quickly offered solutions for the client to choose from.

791
40:48.025 --> 40:49.465
You do look like a consultant now.

792
40:51.785 --> 40:53.545
Congratulations. Your wish came true.

793
40:55.905 --> 40:56.905
Thanks.

794
40:57.505 --> 40:59.505
What's wrong? Not going well?

795
41:00.505 --> 41:01.465
That's not it.

796
41:03.585 --> 41:04.825
Never mind then.

797
41:24.265 --> 41:25.465
Bye, Mr. Yi.

798
41:35.625 --> 41:36.465
Mr. Ye.

799
41:36.545 --> 41:37.465
-Long time no see. -Long time no see.

800
41:37.545 --> 41:38.665
-Everything going well? -Yes.

801
41:39.265 --> 41:41.505
-Come on. Your room is all set. -Alright. Let's go.

802
41:43.225 --> 41:45.265
Wang Yu's hosting a welcome dinner for you tonight.

803
41:45.345 --> 41:46.745
-Great. -We'll have a little drink.

804
41:49.265 --> 41:50.465
SEARCHING FOR YE XINZHI

805
41:50.545 --> 41:52.065
YE XINZHI'S PROFILE

806
41:52.145 --> 41:54.345
2017-2022: ASSOCIATE PARTNER EY HEYI CONSULTING

807
41:54.425 --> 41:56.905
2022-2023: OPERATIONS GM, P&amp;J

808
41:56.985 --> 41:58.745
2023: CMO, ANDE ENERGY

809
41:58.825 --> 42:02.545
2023-PRESENT: GLOBAL MANAGING PARTNER C&amp;C CONSULTING

810
42:03.905 --> 42:05.945
I've finished the revisions. I'll email it to you in a bit.

811
42:06.945 --> 42:07.785
Bye.

812
42:11.145 --> 42:12.505
Sir, your package.

813
42:12.585 --> 42:13.545
Thanks.

814
42:23.145 --> 42:25.705
APOLOGIES AGAIN, AND THANK YOU. XU CHI
